(j)
the professorship, readership, lectureship and other posts which may by instituted and persons who may be appointed
to such professorship, teachership, lecturership and other posts;
(k)
the fees and other charges which may be demanded and received by the Institute;
(l)
the manner in which and the conditions subject to which pension and provident fund may be contributed for and on
behalf of the officers, teachers and other employees of the Institute;
(m)
any other matter for which Regulations may be made under the provisions of this Act.
